# ION MOBILITY, physical (2026-10-16): verdict 1 with the ion rebuilt for a hydrocarbon mobility
# instead of the time-compressed Ar+ template (--ion-speed-scale 1.75).
#   --ion-model reconstructed --ion-mobility K0=<x>   ions.reconstructed_longitudinal: the calib's
#       electron spike, ion charge and birth heights, the ion path rebuilt in the T6 map's E_z/psi.
#   K0 2.05 working value, 1.8 / 2.25 the bracket (reports/Simulating Penning and ion transport.md).
#   Everything else as verdict 1: bG 0.45, tp 166, noise _cmq, rho2M, same clusters and seed.
#   Clusters are the pre-e17c72c Stage A (primaries ~11 % high), the same as verdict 1, on purpose:
#   one variable at a time.
# Evaluate with ledger_m3.py + shape_all.py on yoga (data by TRUE M3 angle), as verdict 1.
#
# PRE-REGISTERED (2026-10-16, before submission). In the 31.0 kV/cm bulk Ar+ has K0 1.212, and
# the reconstruction runs 2.8 % slow against the measured template (test_ion_reconstructed), so
# K0 1.8 / 2.05 / 2.25 act like s ~1.44 / 1.65 / 1.81. From the bgtp scan (§18.7: rise ~ -48 ns
# per unit s, amplitude data/sim ~ -0.2 per unit s), relative to verdict 1:
#   * K0 2.05: inclined rise +2..+8 ns, FWHM +0..+5 ns; p50 data/sim up 0..+4 %. Still inside
#     verdict 1's pre-registered bands (rise +2..+12, Y20 +5..+18; X p50 0.90-1.02).
#   * K0 1.80: rise +10..+20 ns (like s 1.46: X10 rise ~+20 ns over data), p50 data/sim +4..+9 %.
#   * K0 2.25: rise -6..0 ns, p50 data/sim -3..0 %.
#   * saturated fraction X within 0.05 of verdict 1 at every K0; noise unchanged.
# FALSIFIER: K0 2.05 differs from verdict 1 by > 10 ns in any inclined rise or > 6 % in any p50 ->
#   the reconstruction is not equivalent to the scaled template (field/psi profile or birth-height
#   handling matters), and verdict 1's s=1.75 cannot be read as K0 ~2.1.
universe                = vanilla
executable              = /afs/cern.ch/work/d/dneff/mx17_s1/run_stageBC_w2.sh
log                     = /afs/cern.ch/work/d/dneff/mx17_s1/logs/w2.log
request_cpus            = 4
request_memory          = 16000
request_disk            = 12000000
+JobFlavour             = "workday"
MY.SendCredential       = true
environment             = "OMP_NUM_THREADS=4"
arguments               = "rho2M ionK$(tag)_$(ang) /afs/cern.ch/work/d/dneff/mx17_s1/calib/noise_det3_satscan_feu07_cmq.json /afs/cern.ch/work/d/dneff/mx17_s1/clusters_ang/mx17_muons_3k_ang_$(ang)_t0.root '--ion-model reconstructed --ion-mobility K0=$(k0) --feedback-bg 0.45 --shaper-tp-ns 166'"
output                  = /afs/cern.ch/work/d/dneff/mx17_s1/logs/stageBC_ionK$(tag)_$(ang).out
error                   = /afs/cern.ch/work/d/dneff/mx17_s1/logs/stageBC_ionK$(tag)_$(ang).err
queue tag, k0, ang from (
180, 1.80, th00
180, 1.80, thx10
180, 1.80, thx20
180, 1.80, thy10
180, 1.80, thy20
205, 2.05, th00
205, 2.05, thx10
205, 2.05, thx20
205, 2.05, thy10
205, 2.05, thy20
225, 2.25, th00
225, 2.25, thx10
225, 2.25, thx20
225, 2.25, thy10
225, 2.25, thy20
)
